{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkezVG1rkTfYaXdLuuEP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm stopping here. That's six screens and my eyes are tired on this black background.\n\n**What I'd tell my son:**\n\"Look, I found a page called 'מקור'. I don't know who they are, but it says 'מנתוני רשות שוק ההון', which sounds official. If I open one, it would be **הראל** and the **'כספי (שקלי)'** track. Harel is first on the list and a name I know. The page says companies go from the biggest down, and Harel manages '19.1 מיליארד ₪'. In that track it says 'מניות 0%' and 'מט\"ח 0%', so no shares and no dollars, which is what I want. It shows '4.25%' for 3 years and '3.08%' for 5 years. That's about what the bank gives me on a deposit, so I don't see that it's really better. The fee, '0.57% מהחיסכון', worries me, because at the bank I don't pay anything on a deposit. So I'm not sure at all. I won't sign anything until you or the clerk explain whether this beats my deposit.\"\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n- **Screen 1:** The heading 'כל המסלולים בכל החברות'. 'קופת גמל להשקעה' was already marked in green.\n- **Screen 2:** '143 מסלולים של 12 חברות' and the fees, '0.5% עד 0.73%'.\n- **Screens 2–6:** The Harel tracks:\n  - 'אשראי ואג\"ח' has 5% shares, but where the return should be it says 'פחות מ־3 שנים', not a number.\n  - 'מניות' has 24.04%. I didn't trust it; I remember my fund that fell.\n  - 'אג\"ח סחיר' has 0% shares, but again 'פחות מ־3 שנים'.\n  - Then 'כספי (שקלי)'.\n- **Screen 6:** The next company, 'מור', began there. I stopped.\n\n**What I skipped:** The search box and 'מיון', the link 'מה זה קופת גמל להשקעה', 'עוקב מדד S&P 500', 'הלכה', the coloured circles, and all of screens 7–40.\n\n**Where I hesitated:**\n- Hardly any track had 0% shares, and most of those show no number, only 'פחות מ־3 שנים'.\n- Too many numbers on one screen made me anxious.\n\n**Words and signs I didn't understand:**\n- 'סחיר', 'מט\"ח' next to the shares, 'עוקב מדד', 'S&P 500', 'כספי'\n- 'ההפקדות 0%': is that a fee too?\n- The dotted purple lines under the numbers\n- The two colours in the circles\n- '123 ממקור / 123 מחושב'\n\n**What I'd change:** Use a light background. Put one sentence at the top saying which tracks are like a deposit and what the fee costs in shekels. Leave out the tracks that are only shares."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3702,"cache_read_input_tokens":11724,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3702},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c360c76b-79fe-49fa-805c-6f1c066d77e7","uuid":"10727ea2-e9cd-4d55-a619-892531a81c1c","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:33:50.209Z","request_id":"req_011CgkezV2PV7W1sHxPVXzW6"}
